IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CUSTOMER-RANKING.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-N PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-I PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-J PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-LIMIT PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.

01 WS-CUSTOMER-TABLE.
   05 WS-CUSTOMER OCCURS 1000 TIMES.
      10 WS-CUSTOMER-ID PIC X(10).
      10 WS-BALANCE PIC 9(9).

01 WS-TEMP-ID PIC X(10).
01 WS-TEMP-BALANCE PIC 9(9).
01 WS-DISPLAY-BALANCE PIC Z(8)9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    ACCEPT WS-N

    IF WS-N < 1 OR WS-N > 1000
        DISPLAY "INVALID N"
        STOP RUN
    END-IF

    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1
        UNTIL WS-I > WS-N
        ACCEPT WS-CUSTOMER-ID(WS-I)
        ACCEPT WS-BALANCE(WS-I)
    END-PERFORM

    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1
        UNTIL WS-I >= WS-N
        PERFORM VARYING WS-J FROM 1 BY 1
            UNTIL WS-J >= WS-N
            IF WS-BALANCE(WS-J) <
               WS-BALANCE(WS-J + 1)
                PERFORM SWAP-RECORDS
            ELSE
                IF WS-BALANCE(WS-J) =
                   WS-BALANCE(WS-J + 1)
                    IF WS-CUSTOMER-ID(WS-J) >
                       WS-CUSTOMER-ID(WS-J + 1)
                        PERFORM SWAP-RECORDS
                    END-IF
                END-IF
            END-IF
        END-PERFORM
    END-PERFORM

    MOVE WS-N TO WS-LIMIT

    IF WS-N > 3
        MOVE 3 TO WS-LIMIT
    END-IF

    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1
        UNTIL WS-I > WS-LIMIT
        MOVE WS-BALANCE(WS-I)
            TO WS-DISPLAY-BALANCE

        DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CUSTOMER-ID(WS-I))
            " "
            FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISPLAY-BALANCE)
    END-PERFORM

    STOP RUN.

SWAP-RECORDS.
    MOVE WS-CUSTOMER-ID(WS-J) TO WS-TEMP-ID
    MOVE WS-BALANCE(WS-J) TO WS-TEMP-BALANCE

    MOVE WS-CUSTOMER-ID(WS-J + 1)
        TO WS-CUSTOMER-ID(WS-J)
    MOVE WS-BALANCE(WS-J + 1)
        TO WS-BALANCE(WS-J)

    MOVE WS-TEMP-ID TO WS-CUSTOMER-ID(WS-J + 1)
    MOVE WS-TEMP-BALANCE TO WS-BALANCE(WS-J + 1).